WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.200
No! I'm going to my dad!

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:13.011
Dad! A grown-up I don't know had my kite.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:19.039
They gave me candy, and asked me to see a puppy in their car!

00:00:21.038 --> 00:00:26.434
You said no, and you came right to me. I'm so proud of you.

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:30.057
Can you tell me what they looked like?

00:00:30.377 --> 00:00:34.347
A goat. Blue sweater. Round glasses.

00:00:35.697 --> 00:00:40.502
Thank you. That really helps. Let's get your kite together.

00:00:47.822 --> 00:00:52.982
Hoo-ray, Alex! You were a real safety superhero today!

00:00:54.142 --> 00:00:59.102
Remember: Say no. Go to a grown-up. Tell them.

00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:04.312
Wheee! Nuts about safety!

00:01:05.362 --> 00:01:08.292
Be safe, be super!
